{"schemaVersion":1,"sourceRecord":{"schemaVersion":1,"recordId":"wikibooks-18944-r4495247","sourceId":"wikibooks-cookbook-cc-by-sa","sourceTitle":"Cookbook:Baked Leeks","sourcePageId":18944,"sourceRevision":"4495247","sourceRevisionTimestamp":"2025-05-26T23:19:00Z","sourceRevisionUser":"Kittycataclysm","sourceUrl":"https://en.wikibooks.org/w/index.php?title=Cookbook:Baked%20Leeks&oldid=4495247","retrievedAt":"2026-10-13T12:22:56.684Z","sourceCategories":["Category:Albanian recipes","Category:Baked recipes","Category:Recipes","Category:Recipes using leek","Category:Recipes with metric units","Category:Recipes without cooking time"],"license":{"id":"wikibooks-cookbook-cc-by-sa-4.0","name":"Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International (CC BY-SA 4.0); Wikibooks text is generally dual-licensed with GFDL unless otherwise noted","evidenceUrl":"https://en.wikibooks.org/wiki/Wikibooks:Copyrights","policyStatus":"verified-license","pageExceptionStatus":"not-reviewed-per-page","attribution":"Attribute Wikibooks contributors by linking each version-specific source page. Indicate that structured fields are extracted and any translated or edited text is modified. Include CC BY-SA 4.0 notice/link and share adaptations under CC BY-SA 4.0 or later.","changeNoticeRequired":true,"shareAlikeRequired":true},"sourceSha256":"0732756419bc502b369e13ed55512f2013aa3e67c65cdb7316443888239a2249","sourceWikitext":"{{Recipe summary\n| Category = Leek recipes\n| Servings = 4 servings\n}}\n\n{{recipe}}\n\n'''Baked leeks''' (''Tavë me presh'') is an [[Cookbook:Cuisine of Albania|Albanian]] recipe.\n\n== Ingredients ==\n* 2 [[Cookbook:Pound|lb]] (900 [[Cookbook:Gram|g]]) [[Cookbook:leek|leek]]s\n* ½ [[Cookbook:Cup|cup]] [[Cookbook:oil|oil]]\n* ¾ cup [[Cookbook:Chopping|chopped]] [[Cookbook:onion|onion]]\n* ½ lb (225 g) ground [[Cookbook:meat|meat]]\n* 1 [[Cookbook:Tablespoon|tablespoon]] [[Cookbook:Tomato Sauce|tomato sauce]]\n* Mild [[Cookbook:Bell Pepper|red pepper]]\n* [[Cookbook:Salt|Salt]]\n* [[Cookbook:Pepper|Pepper]]\n\n== Procedure ==\n# Cut off the green leaves from leeks. Wash and cut leeks diagonally into 1-[[Cookbook:Inch|inch]] thick slices.\n# [[Cookbook:Sautéing|Sauté]] in a little oil and place in a baking pan. \n# Sauté onion and ground meat in remaining oil.\n# Add beef stock, tomato sauce, red pepper, salt and pepper, and bring to a [[Cookbook:Boiling|boil]].\n# Pour meat mixture over the sautéed leeks.\n# Bake for 1 hour at 375°F (190°C). \n# Serve hot.\n\n==References==\n''This article contains information from [http://www.frosina.org Frosina.org] and it is used with [[w:User:Dori/www.frosina.org permission|permission]].''\n\n[[Category:Albanian recipes|{{PAGENAME}}]]\n[[Category:Recipes using leek|{{PAGENAME}}]]\n[[Category:Baked recipes]]\n[[Category:Recipes with metric units]]","isRecipe":true,"recipe":{"name":"Baked Leeks","nameAr":null,"servings":null,"servingsSourceText":"4 servings","ingredients":[{"id":"source-line-1","name":"2 lb (900 g) leeks","sourceText":"2 lb (900 g) leeks","amountText":"2 lb (900 g) leeks","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-2","name":"½ cup oil","sourceText":"½ cup oil","amountText":"½ cup oil","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-3","name":"¾ cup chopped onion","sourceText":"¾ cup chopped onion","amountText":"¾ cup chopped onion","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-4","name":"½ lb (225 g) ground meat","sourceText":"½ lb (225 g) ground meat","amountText":"½ lb (225 g) ground meat","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-5","name":"1 tablespoon tomato sauce","sourceText":"1 tablespoon tomato sauce","amountText":"1 tablespoon tomato sauce","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-6","name":"Mild red pepper","sourceText":"Mild red pepper","amountText":"Mild red pepper","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-7","name":"Salt","sourceText":"Sal